{"path":"program/abort","title":"abort","titleHtml":"abort","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/program/abort","section":"program","kind":"page","summary":"Causes abnormal program termination unless SIGABRT is being caught by a signal handler passed to signal and the handler does not return.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/program\"><code>&lt;stdlib.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody class=\"t-dcl-rev\">\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-until-c11\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> abort<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-c11\">(until C11)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c11 t-until-c23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">_Noreturn <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> abort<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(since C11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-c23\">(until C23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span>noreturn<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> abort<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c23\">(since C23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Causes abnormal program termination unless <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/program/SIG_types\">SIGABRT</a></span> is being caught by a signal handler passed to signal and the handler does not return.\n</p><p>Functions passed to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/program/atexit\">atexit()</a></span> are not called. Whether open resources such as files are closed is implementation defined. An implementation defined status is returned to the host environment that indicates unsuccessful execution.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>POSIX <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/functions/abort.html\" data-external=\"1\">specifies</a> that the <code>abort()</code> function overrides blocking or ignoring the <code>SIGABRT</code> signal.\n</p><p>Some compiler intrinsics, e.g. <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://gcc.gnu.org/onlinedocs/gcc/Other-Builtins.html\" data-external=\"1\"><code>__builtin_trap</code></a> (gcc, clang, and icc) or <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/intrinsics/fastfail\" data-external=\"1\"><code>__fastfail</code></a>/<a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/intrinsics/debugbreak\" data-external=\"1\"><code>__debugbreak</code></a> (msvc), can be used to terminate the program as fast as possible.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"c\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/FILE\"><span class=\"kw883\">FILE</span></a> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>fp <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/c/io/fopen\"><span class=\"kw818\">fopen</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"data.txt\"</span>,<span class=\"st0\">\"r\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>fp <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <a href=\"/w/c/types/NULL\"><span class=\"kw103\">NULL</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw851\">fprintf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/c/io/std_streams\"><span class=\"kw887\">stderr</span></a>, <span class=\"st0\">\"error opening file data.txt in function main()<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        abort<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"coMULTI\">/* Normal processing continues here. */</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/fclose\"><span class=\"kw821\">fclose</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>fp<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw850\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Normal Return<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>error opening file data.txt in function main()</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-17\">\n<ul><li> C17 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2018): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.22.4.1 The abort function (p: 255)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-11\">\n<ul><li> C11 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2011): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.22.4.1 The abort function (p: 350)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c99\">\n<ul><li> C99 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:1999): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.20.4.1 The abort function (p: 315)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c89\">\n<ul><li> C89/C90 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:1990): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 4.10.4.1 The abort function \n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/program/exit\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>exit</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   causes normal program termination with cleaning up <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/program/atexit\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>atexit</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   registers a function to be called on <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/program/exit\">exit()</a></span> invocation <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/program/quick_exit\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>quick_exit</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   causes normal program termination without completely cleaning up  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/abort\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>abort</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"program","title":"Program support utilities"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"abort","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"3 declarations. Causes abnormal program termination unless SIGABRT is being caught by a signal handler passed to signal and the…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Notes","note":"POSIX specifies that the abort() function overrides blocking or ignoring the SIGABRT signal."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"exit","note":"causes normal program termination with cleaning up"},{"label":"atexit","note":"registers a function to be called on exit() invocation"},{"label":"quick_exit","note":"causes normal program termination without completely cleaning up"}]}]},"standards":["C11","C23"],"wordCount":238,"codeBlockCount":2}
